es":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["agile"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"melee","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!7xweXRZsHWK6AV7Y.6DnRipdoNRQWMUyZ"},{"_id":"vvMB5rLp5hejSAmy","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp","name":"Arrogant Taunts","sort":400000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>The eberark utters crude insults and growls threateningly. Each creature within 30 feet must attempt a @Check[will|dc:27] save.</p>\n<p>The creature is then temporarily immune for 10 minutes.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 2} and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.6uEgoh53GbXuHpTF]{Paralyzed} for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 4} and paralyzed for [[/gmr 1d4 #rounds]]{1d4 rounds}.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["auditory","emotion","fear","mental"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!7xweXRZsHWK6AV7Y.vvMB5rLp5hejSAmy"},{"_id":"wtewhF2XR7w6V0Wm","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Incendiary Spit","sort":500000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>A creature hit by the eberark's spit becomes coated in a slippery, flammable oil.</p>\n<p>The creature must succeed at a @Check[reflex|dc:27] save or become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{Clumsy 2} for as long as they are coated in incendiary spit.</p>\n<p>Creatures affected by incendiary spit that take fire damage catch fire, taking @Damage[3d6[persistent,fire]] damage. Once this persistent fire damage ends, the spit has burned away.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":"incendiary-spit","traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!7xweXRZsHWK6AV7Y.wtewhF2XR7w6V0Wm"},{"_id":"INFGwX7PUOvEy0iD","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/TwoActions.webp","name":"Trail of Flame","sort":600000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":2},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>The eberark Strides twice, leaving a trail of magical fire behind it as it moves. Squares the eberark moves through catch fire, creating a 5-foot-tall wall of flame that burns for 1 round. The wall of flame conceals creatures and objects on the other side of it.</p>\n<p>Any creature that enters or starts its turn in the wall of flame takes @Damage[6d6[fire]] damage (@Check[reflex|dc:27|basic] save).</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["fire"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!7xweXRZsHWK6AV7Y.INFGwX7PUOvEy0iD"}],"name":"Eberark","system":{"abilities":{"cha":{"mod":3},"con":{"mod":5},"dex":{"mod":4},"int":{"mod":2},"str":{"mod":7},"wis":{"mod":3}},"attributes":{"ac":{"details":"","value":30},"allSaves":{"value":"